	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.400" end="00:00:02.767">Here are some words<br />that begin with the letter &quot;d.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.767" end="00:00:04.167">(makes &quot;d&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:05.600" end="00:00:06.667">Drum.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:06.667" end="00:00:08.200">Doll.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:08.200" end="00:00:09.800">Dipper.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:09.800" end="00:00:11.733">Dollar.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:11.733" end="00:00:13.200">Dog.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:13.200" end="00:00:14.800">Dime.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.800" end="00:00:16.867">Dreamcatcher.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:16.867" end="00:00:17.733">&quot;D.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:17.733" end="00:00:18.733">(makes &quot;d&quot; sound)</p>
